      "created_at": "2022-10-26T19:39:43Z",
      "updated_at": "2022-10-26T19:39:43Z",
      "body": "For me \"Manual Recovery\" is not an option @arv187 :) Two reasons;\r\n\r\n1. I will never work (spend my time) for someone who can not stand after their decision and want to come back after requesting data removal.\r\n\r\n2. Because of the above, I already wrote my own cron powered code which removes every single record of a pilot (or created by that pilot) once it gets gets deleted. I do not care the numbers they left behind, I am not after some shiny stats ;)\r\n\r\nI would advise the same for every other admin, time is important and we should be enjoying our hobby, not spending it for babysitting :)\r\n\r\nSafe flights",
